.ionide

### OS Junk ###
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

### Editor / Temporary Files ###
*.orig
*.TMP
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
